div.p:
Taking into consideration that certain governments
have rejected the appeal of the United Nations Mediator for prolongation of the
truce in Palestine;

Determines that the situation in Palestine
constitutes a threat to the peace within the meaning of Article 39 of the
Charter;

Orders all governments and authorities which have
not already done so to accept immediately the prolongation of the truce for such
period as may be decided by the Mediator;
